<MainLayout>
<header><div class="top"><div class="container topin"><span>Complete Solar & Energy Solutions</span><div><a href="tel:+919049041394">90490 41394</a>　·　<a href="tel:+917447433471">74474 33471</a>　·　<a href="mailto:unicornsolarenergy03@gmail.com">unicornsolarenergy03@gmail.com</a></div></div></div>
<div class="container navrow"><a href="#" aria-label="Unicorn Solar Energy home"><img class="logo" src="/images/logo/unicorn-solar-horizontal.png" alt="Unicorn Solar Energy"></a><button class="menubtn" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button><nav><a href="#solutions">Solutions</a><a href="#industries">Industries</a><a href="#process">Our Process</a><a href="#projects">Installations</a><a href="#about">About</a><a class="navcta" href="#contact">Get a Proposal ↗</a></nav></div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="heroimage"></div><div class="heroshade"></div><div class="container herotext"><div class="eyebrow light">ENGINEERED AROUND YOUR ENERGY NEEDS</div><h1>Complete Solar<br><em>& Energy Solutions.</em></h1><p class="lead">Smarter energy solutions for businesses, industries, educational institutions, hotels and homes.</p><p class="sublead">From rooftop solar and battery storage to efficient hot-water systems, we help you explore the right solution for your site, usage and budget.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn orange" href="#contact">Request a Free Site Survey ↗</a><a class="btn ghost" href="https://wa.me/919049041394?text=Hello%20Unicorn%20Solar%20Energy%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20an%20energy%20solution." target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chat on WhatsApp ↗</a></div><p class="free">✓　Free consultation, energy assessment and proposal</p></div><div class="herobottom"><div class="container">PUNE & PCMC · MAHARASHTRA <span>Solar · Storage · Hot Water</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="about"><div class="container intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">A PRACTICAL APPROACH TO ENERGY</div><h2>Good energy decisions<br>start with <em>understanding.</em></h2></div><div class="copy"><p>At Unicorn Solar Energy, we help customers evaluate clean-energy options based on their actual requirements—not a one-size-fits-all package.</p><p>We begin by understanding how your site uses energy, then help you assess suitable solar, battery storage and water-heating solutions with clear guidance throughout the process.</p><a class="link" href="#process">See how we work →</a></div></div><div class="container values"><div><b>01</b>Requirement-led design</div><div><b>02</b>Component flexibility</div><div><b>03</b>Clear project guidance</div><div><b>04</b>Support through the process</div></div></section>
<section class="section pale" id="solutions"><div class="container"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="eyebrow">OUR ENERGY SOLUTIONS</div><h2>One partner. <em>More ways to save.</em></h2></div><p>Explore options for electricity generation, energy storage and hot-water requirements.</p></div><div class="cards">{services.map((s,i)=><article class="card"><div class="cardtop"><span class="icon">{s[0]}</span><span class="num">0{i+1}</span></div><h3>{s[1]}</h3><p>{s[2]}</p><a href="#contact">Enquire about this solution <b>↗</b></a></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section dark" id="industries"><div class="container indlayout"><div><div class="eyebrow light">WHO WE WORK WITH</div><h2>Solutions for the way <em>you operate.</em></h2><p class="indcopy">Different sites have different loads, operating hours and priorities. We take those details into account when discussing the right energy solution.</p><a class="btn orange" href="#contact">Discuss Your Project ↗</a></div><div class="indgrid">{industries.map((x,i)=><article><small>0{i+1}</small><h3>{x[0]}</h3><p>{x[1]}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="process"><div class="container"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="eyebrow">HOW WE DESIGN A SOLAR SYSTEM</div><h2>A clear process.<br><em>From first conversation to handover.</em></h2></div><p>Each project follows a practical sequence, with scope and technical suitability considered before installation.</p></div><div class="steps">{steps.map(s=><article><span>{s[0]}</span><h3>{s[1]}</h3><p>{s[2]}</p></article>)}</div><div class="note"><b>Net-metering support:</b> We assist with documentation, application, follow-up and coordination through the applicable approval process.</div></div></section>
<section class="section pale"><div class="container"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="eyebrow">COMPONENTS & MATERIALS</div><h2>Selected for the project.<br><em>Not one-size-fits-all.</em></h2></div><p>Component options are discussed based on technical suitability, customer preference, availability and budget.</p></div><div class="brands"><article><small>SOLAR PANELS</small><h3>Waaree · Adani · Premier Energies</h3><p>Other brands can be considered as per client requirements.</p></article><article><small>INVERTERS</small><h3>Sungrow · Deye · Growatt · GoodWe</h3><p>Selected around system design and project needs.</p></article><article><small>STRUCTURES</small><h3>Apollo HDGI · GI</h3><p>Material selected with site conditions and budget in mind.</p></article><article><small>BALANCE OF SYSTEM</small><h3>Polycab cables & safety components</h3><p>Electrical accessories selected with applicable standards and safety requirements in mind.</p></article></div><p class="fineprint">Brands and specifications depend on project requirements, availability and client selection.</p></div></section>
<section class="section" id="projects"><div class="container"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="eyebrow">SELECTED INSTALLATIONS</div><h2>Real work. <em>Thoughtful execution.</em></h2></div><p>A look at rooftop solar installation work completed by Unicorn Solar Energy.</p></div><div class="gallery gallery-expanded"><figure class="feature"><img src="/images/projects/installation-new-01.jpg" alt="Elevated rooftop solar panel installation" loading="lazy"><figcaption>ROOFTOP SOLAR<strong>Elevated panel structure</strong></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/projects/installation-new-02.jpg" alt="Solar panels arranged on a rooftop" loading="lazy"><figcaption>ROOFTOP SOLAR<strong>Panel layout</strong></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/projects/installation-new-03.jpg" alt="Solar panels on a rooftop" loading="lazy"><figcaption>SOLAR INSTALLATION<strong>Completed rooftop system</strong></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/projects/installation-new-04.jpg" alt="Solar installation overview" loading="lazy"><figcaption>PROJECT VIEW<strong>Rooftop installation</strong></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/projects/installation-new-05.jpg" alt="Solar panels on an elevated rooftop structure" loading="lazy"><figcaption>INSTALLATION DETAIL<strong>Panel and structure</strong></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/projects/installation-new-06.jpg" alt="Rooftop solar installation detail" loading="lazy"><figcaption>SOLAR PANELS<strong>Installed system</strong></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/projects/installation-04.jpeg" alt="Solar panels installed on a rooftop" loading="lazy"><figcaption>INSTALLATION DETAIL<strong>Rooftop system</strong></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="/images/projects/installation-bhairav-nagar.jpg" alt="Solar installation site overview" loading="lazy"><figcaption>PROJECT PHOTOGRAPHY<strong>Site overview</strong></figcaption></figure></div><div class="video-section"><div class="eyebrow">FROM THE SITE</div><h3>Installation videos</h3><p>Short videos showing installation work and rooftop systems.</p><div class="video-grid"><figure><video controls preload="metadata" poster="/images/projects/installation-new-01.jpg"><source src="/videos/solar-installation-video-01.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption>Solar installation walkthrough</figcaption></figure><figure><video controls preload="metadata" poster="/images/projects/installation-new-02.jpg"><source src="/videos/solar-installation-video-02.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption>Rooftop solar system</figcaption></figure><figure><video controls preload="metadata" poster="/images/projects/installation-new-03.jpg"><source src="/videos/solar-installation-video-03.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption>Installation progress</figcaption></figure><figure><video controls preload="metadata" poster="/images/projects/installation-new-04.jpg"><source src="/videos/solar-installation-video-04.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption>Solar project video</figcaption></figure><figure><video controls preload="metadata" poster="/images/projects/installation-new-05.jpg"><source src="/videos/solar-installation-video-05.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption>Rooftop project clip</figcaption></figure></div></div><p class="fineprint">Project photographs and videos are shared for portfolio purposes. Customer-specific technical and location details are not displayed.</p></div></section>
<section class="band"><div class="container bandin"><div><div class="eyebrow light">START WITH A CONVERSATION</div><h2>Let's find the right energy solution <em>for your site.</em></h2><p>Tell us what you need. We'll help you understand the practical next steps.</p></div><a class="btn orange" href="#contact">Request a Free Proposal ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container faq"><div><div class="eyebrow">COMMON QUESTIONS</div><h2>Good questions.<br><em>Clear answers.</em></h2><p>Not sure where to begin? These are useful starting points.</p></div><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Which solar system is right for my property? <b>+</b></summary><p>It depends on electricity usage, connection type, site conditions, available space and whether backup power is needed. A site assessment helps determine suitable options.</p></details><details><summary>Do you assist with net metering? <b>+</b></summary><p>Yes. We assist with documentation, application, follow-up and coordination through the relevant process. Approval is subject to applicable DISCOM requirements.</p></details><details><summary>Can you recommend components within my budget? <b>+</b></summary><p>Yes. We discuss component options based on budget, technical suitability and your preferences, while keeping safety and system requirements in view.</p></details><details><summary>Do you provide a site survey and proposal? <b>+</b></summary><p>Yes. We offer a free consultation, site survey, energy assessment and proposal.</p></details><details><summary>Do you provide battery storage and hot-water solutions? <b>+</b></summary><p>Yes. Our services include BESS, solar water heaters and heat-pump water-heating solutions. Suitability depends on site requirements.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="section contact" id="contact"><div class="container contactlayout"><div><div class="eyebrow light">CONTACT UNICORN SOLAR ENERGY</div><h2>Have a project<br>in <em>mind?</em></h2><p class="contactcopy">Speak with us about solar power, battery storage or hot-water solutions for your property.</p><div class="contactlines"><a href="tel:+919049041394"><small>CALL US</small><strong>+91 90490 41394</strong></a><a href="tel:+917447433471"><small>CALL US</small><strong>+91 74474 33471</strong></a><a href="mailto:unicornsolarenergy03@gmail.com"><small>EMAIL</small><strong>unicornsolarenergy03@gmail.com</strong></a><div><small>OFFICE</small><strong>51/84, Bhairav Nagar, Dhanori Road,<br>Vishrantwadi, Pune – 411015</strong></div><div><small>BUSINESS HOURS</small><strong>Monday – Sunday · 10:00 AM – 8:00 PM</strong></div></div><a class="maplink" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/oAsrnUtdd2C9kkUL9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Google Maps directions ↗</a></div><div class="formbox"><small>FREE CONSULTATION</small><h3>Tell us about your project</h3><p>Share a few details and we'll prepare an enquiry message for WhatsApp.</p><form id="leadform"><div class="formrow"><label>Your name<input name="name" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Full name"></label><label>Phone number<input name="phone" required inputmode="tel" pattern="[0-9+() -]{8,20}" placeholder="Mobile number"></label></div><label>I'm interested in<select name="interest" required><option value="">Choose a solution</option><option>On-Grid Solar</option><option>Off-Grid Solar</option><option>Hybrid Solar</option><option>Ground-Mounted Solar</option><option>Battery Energy Storage System (BESS)</option><option>Solar Water Heater</option><option>Heat Pump Water Heating</option><option>Net Metering Assistance</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select></label><label>Property type<select name="property"><option>Commercial</option><option>School / College</option><option>Industrial</option><option>Hotel / Hospitality</option><option>Residential</option><option>Hospital / Healthcare</option><option>Housing Society</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label>Project details<textarea name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Requirements (optional)"></textarea></label><button class="btn orange submit" type="submit">Prepare WhatsApp Enquiry ↗</button><p class="fineprint">WhatsApp opens with a pre-filled message for you to review and send. No information is submitted automatically.</p></form></div></div></section>
